<title>INDIA: Indian inflation slips to 7.64 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian inflation slips to 7.64 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index fell to 7.64 percent in the week ending January 11 from 7.75 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>WHOLESALE PRICES	  Jan 11, 1997    Jan 4, 1997 Jan 13, 1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +7.64	   +7.75	   +4.87</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  319.8	   319.8	   297.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended January 13, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
